{"summary":"白石华是一种矿物药材，味辛、无毒，具有清热生津、止渴利尿的功效，主要用于治疗消渴病、膀胱热等症。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"《别录》曰︰味辛，无毒。主瘅消渴，膀胱热。生腋北乡北邑山，采无时。","translation":"《别录》记载：味辛，无毒。主治瘅病、消渴、膀胱热。产于腋北乡北邑山，随时可采。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":""},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E9%87%91%E7%9F%B3%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%94#白石華","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:57.612Z"}